      "content": "so i finally did it. i got the promotion, the corner office, the whole thing. everything i spent the last ten years working for is right here in front of me. \n\nbut i’m just sitting here staring at the view and i feel... nothing. it’s like i climbed this massive mountain just to realize there’s nothing at the top. a total void. i feel like i've reached the end of the script and i don't know why i'm still supposed to keep playing the part.",
